   "visual": {"type": "quote", "tag": "WHAT NETFLIX'S CFO SAID", "size": 60, "quote": "“…paid sharing was our primary revenue accelerator… this year.”", "who": "Spencer Neumann, Netflix CFO · Q3 2023 earnings call"}
  },
  {
